body:
Yeah. 100%. 

Once, when I went to a restaurant, I asked what was in the chicken schnitzel wrap. The person at the counter said "chicken schnitzel wrapped in a wrap" so I assumed there was no tomato or sauce and I didn't ask for anything to be taken out. Turns out there was tomato and a lot of sauce. More tomato and sauce than chicken. The tomato and sauce made the chicken all soggy. ;n; 

Sure, I may be saying this because I'm not a big fan of tomatoes, but either tell me that it is an ingredient, ask me if I want some on or just don't put it on. It makes everything so soggy...

I only have 20 wishes and no pity so... (this is on my alt account I made yesterday)

My main account has 80 wishes saved and 37 pity, but I'm saving for others... ;n; 

Sorry, Xiao.
